{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839360/extras/5ae5dc1e74f74ec7332c033635ecc3cd.avif?t=1772005627\" width=620 height=47 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839360/extras/be7c5150a60352488abe411d13e047d5.poster.avif?t=1772005627\" width=326 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839360/extras/be7c5150a60352488abe411d13e047d5.webm?t=1772005627\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839360/extras/be7c5150a60352488abe411d13e047d5.mp4?t=1772005627\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Tiny Birdtopia</i>, your PC desktop isn\u2019t just your workspace\u2014but your very own bird sanctuary! Whether you\u2019re in a meeting, drafting a report, or browsing the web, you can effortlessly manage your feathered paradise. Collect and nurture birds, unlock hidden species, and customize your birdtopia to your heart\u2019s content\u2014turn every work break into a chorus of birdsong!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839360/extras/c2dbcbc2a6abf90be110b242d24f663d.poster.avif?t=1772005627\" width=772 height=486 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839360/extras/c2dbcbc2a6abf90be110b242d24f663d.webm?t=1772005627\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839360/extras/c2dbcbc2a6abf90be110b242d24f663d.mp4?t=1772005627\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839360/extras/d80372b4462f7390608f9265d30c8fc7.avif?t=1772005627\" width=620 height=47 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every bird boasts its own unique plumage\u2014gather their feathers to unlock secret, rare species! Explore the in-game <i>Birddex</i> to learn about each bird\u2019s habits, habitats, and even listen to their distinctive calls. Whether you\u2019re looking for a moment of calm or you\u2019re a dedicated bird enthusiast, Tiny Birdtopia is the perfect pick-me-up between tasks!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839360/extras/c63b65b059aadaead57a9b7b256388c8.poster.avif?t=1772005627\" width=773 height=486 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839360/extras/c63b65b059aadaead57a9b7b256388c8.webm?t=1772005627\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839360/extras/1cf26f17146eb85230654854eb024bb5.poster.avif?t=1772005627\" width=918 height=468 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839360/extras/1cf26f17146eb85230654854eb024bb5.webm?t=1772005627\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839360/extras/1cf26f17146eb85230654854eb024bb5.mp4?t=1772005627\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839360/extras/1af45cf5fb13357e6d6c87d57ab0daa7.avif?t=1772005627\" width=620 height=47 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a relaxing idle game, your birds will grow over time while you focus on your work\u2014just sit back and watch them thrive!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839360/extras/2c7caa50f8b2c505d906f7f58c9acc3a.poster.avif?t=1772005627\" width=1170 height=242 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839360/extras/2c7caa50f8b2c505d906f7f58c9acc3a.webm?t=1772005627\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839360/extras/2c7caa50f8b2c505d906f7f58c9acc3a.mp4?t=1772005627\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839360/extras/73035d4338b0c24b4e0eda47deeed9aa.poster.avif?t=1772005627\" width=450 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839360/extras/73035d4338b0c24b4e0eda47deeed9aa.webm?t=1772005627\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839360/extras/73035d4338b0c24b4e0eda47deeed9aa.mp4?t=1772005627\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3839360?t=17720