 Birdtopia</i>, your PC desktop isn\u2019t just your workspace\u2014but your very own bird sanctuary! Whether you\u2019re in a meeting, drafting a report, or browsing the web, you can effortlessly manage your feathered paradise. Collect and nurture birds, unlock hidden species, and customize your birdtopia to your heart\u2019s content\u2014turn every work break into a chorus of birdsong!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839360/extras/c2dbcbc2a6abf90be110b242d24f663d.poster.avif?t=1772005627\" width=772 height=486 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839360/extras/c2dbcbc2a6abf90be110b242d24f663d.webm?t=1772005627\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839360/extras/c2dbcbc2a6abf90be110b242d24f663d.mp4?t=1772005627\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839360/extras/d80372b4462f7390608f9265d30c8fc7.avif?t=1772005627\" width=620 height=47 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every bird boasts its own unique plumage\u2014gather their feathers to unlock secret, rare species! Explore the in-game <i>Birddex</i> to learn about each bird\u2019s habits, habitats, and even listen to their distinctive calls. Whether you\u2019re looking for a moment of calm or you\u2019re a dedicated bird enthusiast, Tiny Birdtopia is the perfect pick-me-up between tasks!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https:/